#tutor07
From : Colonel K.Rorscham
       Vandaum Headquarters

For : % &
      Royan base

You are finally starting to earn your pay &.
The Royan sector is now under our control. I must admit
that you have had something to do with this victory.

Well, the holidays are over now, we will see if you deserve
to play in the adult's world. You leave tomorrow for the
PETRA sector.

The Petra archipelago is the scene of fierce fighting between
Communists and Capitalists. The stake is the control of the
region's important oil resources. Our two enemies have been 
fighting for months and are starting to show weaknesses.
We think that it is time to take advantage of the situation.

We control a small base on the island of PIRAN, the attack
will be launched from there. Your first objective is the big
island of BALINA. Our adversaries have engaged in a real
trench war. If you choose to attack the communist base first
the easiest is to navigate due WEST, with regards to the
Capitalists they are to the EAST.

Our researchers have produced a new and more powerful
armoured tank, you will write a report about its 
performances for me.

In order to do so you must survive.